Session handoff needed. Transfer at the next safe checkpoint,
not after completing the whole task.

Finish only tightly coupled work already in flight that must settle
for safe transfer. Independent terminals and background jobs may
continue; do not wait for them. Start no new task work to delay handoff.

Fetch the template, file path and ID from the template tool before
writing. Fetch early if useful while reaching the checkpoint.
